## 9.2 Standard Response Statuses

Define these statuses:

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| accepted | Request accepted by the runtime |
| queued | Waiting for execution |
| running | Agent execution is in progress |
| awaiting_tool | Waiting for an authorized tool result |
